From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:53:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Retain gateway outcome custody on abandoned worker
 waits

Capture the run-owned holder on timeout/cancel before handler refresh; preserve completed receipts against cached agent reuse. Normalize absent SIDs and exercise the production executor context hop.

Proof: 126 affected files: 1504 passed, 1 skipped. Five revision mutants killed with 15-test green baseline, including omitted abandonment capture and receipt overwrite.
